WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,930 --> 00:00:06,512
Hello

2
00:00:06,512 --> 00:00:19,047
I am Wanwan’s brother

3
00:00:19,047 --> 00:00:24,420
Pei Jingchang

4
00:00:24,420 --> 00:00:28,860
It's obviously the first time we meet

5
00:00:28,860 --> 00:00:31,240
