8
00:00:40,660 --> 00:00:43,730
Jingchang is right, he is an honest boy

9
00:00:43,730 --> 00:00:45,730
Just right for Wanwan

10
00:00:45,730 --> 00:00:49,140
Nothing left to chance

11
00:00:49,140 --> 00:00:54,020
Hello uncle, hello auntie
